{"3647460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Krampus’ Work", "steam_appid": 3647460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Christmas is a magical time… but not for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krampus’ Work</strong> is a cozy but slightly dark indie third-person adventure where you play as a small demon working for Krampus himself. Your mission is simple: punish those who behaved badly and make their perfect holiday evening a little less perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore several houses, each with its own story and unique set of tasks. Steal gifts, confuse the residents, disrupt the warm atmosphere — do whatever it takes to make sure the undeserving don’t enjoy a flawless Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>unconventional movement abilities</strong>: run across ceilings and walls, slip into unexpected places, hide in shadows, and take advantage of your demonic agility to avoid being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware. Each house has <strong>smart NPCs</strong> following their own routines: cooking, relaxing, moving from room to room, checking strange noises, and reacting dynamically to your presence. You’ll need to be clever to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 <strong>Cozy Christmas atmosphere</strong> with a subtle dark twist — like a holiday postcard someone accidentally set on fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈 <strong>Play as a demon-servant of Krampus</strong> — small, sneaky, and highly agile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 <strong>Multiple unique houses</strong>, each with its own tasks and inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>Holiday sabotage</strong>: steal gifts, confuse residents, and break the festive mood — every “naughty” person has their own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Smart NPCs</strong> with natural behavior and daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Vertical gameplay and parkour</strong>: ceiling-running and other unconventional mobility options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>Indie vibe</strong> — compact, atmospheric, focused on mood and a unique concept.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Christmas is a magical time… but not for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krampus’ Work</strong> is a cozy but slightly dark indie third-person adventure where you play as a small demon working for Krampus himself. Your mission is simple: punish those who behaved badly and make their perfect holiday evening a little less perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore several houses, each with its own story and unique set of tasks. Steal gifts, confuse the residents, disrupt the warm atmosphere — do whatever it takes to make sure the undeserving don’t enjoy a flawless Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>unconventional movement abilities</strong>: run across ceilings and walls, slip into unexpected places, hide in shadows, and take advantage of your demonic agility to avoid being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware. Each house has <strong>smart NPCs</strong> following their own routines: cooking, relaxing, moving from room to room, checking strange noises, and reacting dynamically to your presence. You’ll need to be clever to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 <strong>Cozy Christmas atmosphere</strong> with a subtle dark twist — like a holiday postcard someone accidentally set on fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈 <strong>Play as a demon-servant of Krampus</strong> — small, sneaky, and highly agile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 <strong>Multiple unique houses</strong>, each with its own tasks and inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>Holiday sabotage</strong>: steal gifts, confuse residents, and break the festive mood — every “naughty” person has their own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Smart NPCs</strong> with natural behavior and daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Vertical gameplay and parkour</strong>: ceiling-running and other unconventional mobility options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>Indie vibe</strong> — compact, atmospheric, focused on mood and a unique concept.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A cozy yet dark Christmas-themed third-person 3D adventure where you play as a demon, a loyal servant of Krampus, tasked with ruining the holidays for those who truly deserve it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647460/cadafa01132fb996703afe02a38e2322f6d2e382/header.jpg?t=1780904599", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647460/6baf146b09771ae73dafb3330488ca0a8a144aff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780904599", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647460/6baf146b09771ae73dafb3330488ca0a8a144aff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780904599", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 2020M 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements":